      'In a pitcher combine the fruit, orange juice, sugar (or sweetener), cinnamon stick and orange peel strip. Stir so the sugar dissolves in the juice.',
      'Pour in the red wine (young and fruity, no need for an expensive one) and stir. In fit mode, use iced red tea.',
